  m_text: "Tags: \r\n- Extremely rich ( heavy cream and cheese usage) \n- High fat
    / High calories \n\r\nHealth Advice: \r\nCream and cheese are the biggest contributors
    to the high calories & fat. Using light cream or evaporated milk and going easy
    on the cheese lopping can bring fat levels down without losing the \u2018Rose\u2019
    characteristic of this dish variant.\n\nPortions | Calories | Protein | Carbs
    | Fats\n      1 \t  909  \t 21g        26       83g\n      2 \t  1818  \t 42g       
    52g     166g\n      4          3636  \t 84g        104g   332g\n      6         
    5454  \t 126g      156g   498g"
